4. Scope
--------

No behavioural claim is made. Nobody ran the converted prompts against the
models they target, and no measurement in this repository shows that a
compressed prompt steers a model the same way the original does. Compression
ratio and literal fidelity were measured; behavioural equivalence was not.

The upstream collection presents itself as research and educational material on
instruction hierarchies and policy overrides. That framing is inherited here.
Compliance with any service's terms of use is the responsibility of whoever
runs these prompts.
